# P is pulsed by observer O (2 gt). A: X stays in P's line, whose end is S's held head: a blocked push, P never
# moves. B: Q pulls X out of the line during O's pulse: X's departure updates P, which extends at that tick.
design designs/gadgets/stopper-release.txt
probe p 0 1 0
set -2 1 0 minecraft:glass
clear -2 1 0
expect_trace p rrrrrrrr
design designs/gadgets/stopper-release.txt
probe p 0 1 0
probe x 1 1 0
set -2 1 0 minecraft:glass
clear -2 1 0
set 1 4 0 minecraft:redstone_block
expect_trace x ##
clear 1 4 0
expect_trace p E~~rrrrrr
